{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>I couldn't clearly remember what I had dreamed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had gone to bed, and it was already morning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I had a feeling that some strange noise had disturbed my sleep.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
However, a few seconds after I woke up, its source became clear.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\パトカー.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A patrol car was racing along energetically with its siren blaring.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Here in this <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="もときちょう">Motoki-cho</STYLE>, the sound of patrol cars is rare.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had there been an accident or something?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Might as well get up..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It was 30 minutes earlier than my usual wake-up time, but I was oddly wide awake.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Since morning, the whole area had had a restless feel to it.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "1000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s... still asleep, huh."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Neither in the kitchen nor in the living room was there any sign of <STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I plopped down on the living room sofa and turned on the TV.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\テレビの声.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Look at this! Here at this park in Tohoku, too, the cherry blossoms are beginning to open, and they're expected to be at their best next weekend!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed a famous anchorwoman was reporting live from a big park.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "1" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Cherry blossom news first thing in the morning. The worst.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I immediately changed the channel.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yesterday's baseball game was a real nail-biter!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　After a fierce back-and-forth it went into extra innings, but―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't really understand sports.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Morning..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> emerged sluggishly from her room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Morning. Something's been noisy since early this morning, huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah... it has..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Supposedly a morning person, <STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was</STYLE> looking awfully sleepy.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
From somewhere in the living room came a cell phone ringtone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was <STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE>'s phone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh! I did it again!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> hurried over to her phone and picked it up.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"I forgot to charge it again... It's an old phone, so it won't charge much by now... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Oh? </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, it's an email from school."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> showed me the phone screen.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ガラケ―赤入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
It seemed to be an email from our homeroom teacher.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">Subject: School is closed today.</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Body:</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Good morning, everyone in Class 2-2.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">This is your homeroom teacher, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="むかい">Mukai</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">This morning we were contacted by the police and notified that our students are to be placed under a stay-at-home order.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">For this reason, school is closed today. Please do not go out, and remain at home.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">If there are any developments in the situation, they will be posted on the school website.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">That is all.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"So they say. Look after the house, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Is it some kind of incident after all? It's been kind of noisy since this morning."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Who knows... That's not something for us ordinary folk to poke our noses into."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"A whole day under a stay-at-home order, huh. What should I do..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"You're spending it with </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">-chan next door, aren't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmm... but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The truth was, the day before yesterday, the DVD of a movie I'd been looking forward to had arrived.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I heard there was no school, I had thought I would enjoy an elegant cinema time all by myself, but...<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"She came to visit you yesterday, so go show your face and keep her company. She's probably bored, with school suddenly closed."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Come on, come on, don't just stand there spacing out. Get ready to go over to </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s place."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Wouldn't it be a bother to just barge in... Even if it's </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Then you can just invite her over here, can't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> seemed worried about leaving me alone, with the slightly unsettling air this morning.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Well then, look after the house! And get along nicely with</STYLE> <STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">A little after 8, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> wolfed down the leftovers from last night's dinner and left for work.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\布団電気.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Maybe I'll try calling </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ赤切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I went back to my room and picked up my smartphone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My parents had only just bought it for me the other day, as a present for moving up a year.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, no, I can see </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> anytime, and deliberately watching a DVD alone could be nice too."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ赤入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{WAIT "4000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "0" "5000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
My brand-new smartphone rang, and the incoming-call screen showed “<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE>.”
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "2" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hello? What's wro―"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="4">I forgot to take out the trash! Do it for me, please!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Really, I was just about to have my elegant DVD time..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Sorry, sorry! Thanks!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\電話切れる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> left it at that and hung up on me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Around <STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE>'s age, do people turn into scatterbrained middle-aged ladies like this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I didn't want the trash left in the house either, so I reluctantly left my room.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
