{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関閉.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ゴミ袋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "500" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
When I got to the entryway, a single big trash bag was sitting there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To leave something this big sitting here and forget it...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Heave-<TXSPS>hooooo<TXSPN>!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Holding the trash bag in both hands, I shoved the door open with my whole body.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関開.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
And then,
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Ouch!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The moment the door hit something, I heard a woman's small shriek.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "日曜日の朝.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Ah, sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Oh my, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">-chan! Good morning, good morning!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently the door I had opened had hit <STYLE ID="8">Obasan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her voice was high-energy first thing in the morning, as always.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Good morning. Sorry, the trash bag was big, so I kind of rammed the door open."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Hohoho, I'm fine!</STYLE> <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">-chan, are you taking out the trash too?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah. Oh, you too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"That's right! It's getting warmer, so you have to put the kitchen scraps out right away!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I headed with <STYLE ID="8">Obasan</STYLE> to the apartment building's elevator.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
