{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">-chan, how are you feeling? I believe my </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> went to visit you yesterday?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm feeling good today, thanks!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Oh my! That's wonderful!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now that she mentioned it, I realized my body was in really good shape today.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The weather was calm too, with no wind at all.<PG>
Anyway, I had heard that <STYLE ID="8">Haruka's mom</STYLE> here was a childhood friend of <STYLE ID="4">my mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was relatively warm today, but even so, she was wearing a revealing combination: sleeveless top and miniskirt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An outfit even someone my age would hesitate to put together.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's hard to say out loud, but at her age, I really have to wonder about dressing like that.<PG>
She's youthful and beautiful and has a good figure, I admit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I feel like it's starting to be a bit of a stretch.<PG>
Or rather, the way she talks sounds more like a middle-aged lady than <STYLE ID="4">my mom</STYLE> does.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe she gets all hyped up to show off how young she is, but it seems to backfire.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How should I put it... 
{PAUSE ""}
Yeah, it's painful...<PG>
